# 6. ONE THING I WOULD CHANGE IN THE CURRENT SCHEDULE

Your current Schedule has:

```text
SETS
REPS
```

For example:

> Bench Press — 3 sets × 8 reps

**That is perfectly fine.**

Those values represent the **planned prescription**.

But Schedule should NOT contain things like:

```text
Actual weight
Actual reps
RIR
RPE
Actual rest
Actual performance
```

Those belong to **Workout**.

So:

### Schedule

```text
Bench Press
3 × 8
```

means:

> **Plan:** 3 sets of 8.

### Workout

```text
Bench Press

Set 1
80kg × 8

Set 2
80kg × 8

Set 3
82.5kg × 7
```

means:

> **Actual performance.**

That separation is extremely important for everything we want to build later.

